<usx version="3.0"><chapter style="c" number="5" altnumber="5a" sid=" 5"/><char style="ca">5b</char> Stray text on the chapter line after a second ca, before any paragraph.<para style="p"><verse style="v" number="1" sid=""/>Chapter 5 holds deliberately damaged USFM that can still exist at rest in a Paratext 9 project. A nameless marker follows this sentence. </para><para style="">2 <verse style="v" number="2" sid=""/>A bare backslash after a character marker <char style="bd" closed="false"/></para><para style="">text after it. <verse style="v" number="3" sid=""/>A bare backslash at the end of a verse </para><para style=""/><para style="b">Stray text after a blank-line marker.</para><chapter eid=" 5"/></usx>